    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. one thing tho, some of the board members are saying that the 'universal museum' argument feels a bit outdated and just sounds like a way to justify keeping stolen goods. do you think that's a fair critique, or is there still a valid point to be made for keeping everything in big global museums?",
